data: {"id": "5fb32152cf2b4783-thinking-parallel_evidence-723", "run_id": "5fb32152cf2b4783", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集结论\n\n### 已确认事实（来自真实工具结果）\n\n**1. Kubernetes 状态（kubectl_describe）**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 当前状态为 **Pending**（ContainerCreating），未运行\n- 调度在 **node2 (10.2.0.50)**\n- 容器 `app` 状态：Waiting，Reason = ContainerCreating，Restart Count = 0\n- **关键事件**（持续 54 分钟）：\n  - `FailedMount` (x33, 最近 3m55s): `hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory`\n  - `FailedMount` (x20, 最近 9m28s): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]`\n\n**2. M", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789129998406, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

