data: {"id": "5fb32152cf2b4783-final", "run_id": "5fb32152cf2b4783", "seq": 728, "ts_ms": 1789130014665, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | HostPath volume 'input' 指向的路径 '/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input' 在 node2 上不是目录（不存在或类型不符），导致 kubelet 挂载失败，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `event.message` | `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory` (fact-344ed05a4cb2) | 确认挂载失败的根本原因是宿主机路径类型检查未通过 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `pod.status` | `Pending` (fact-2fc3d0844d5c) | 确认 Pod 因挂载问题卡在初始化阶段，处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 3 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` | `ContainerCreating` (fact-c440a7d7c00b) | 确认容器等待原因符合预期，且未因 OOM 或 Crash 重启 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` | `0` (fact-793aa471cfc1) | 确认容器无重启记录，排除运行时崩溃因素 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.cpu` | `50m` (fact-29e71900d712) | 确认资源限制存在，排除因资源竞争导致的调度延迟 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` | `8Mi` (fact-7c0cf47552f8) | 确认资源请求存在，排除因资源不足导致的 Pending |\n\n**证据印证与说明**：\n- 证据 1 (K8s Event) 直接指出了 `hostPath` 类型检查失败，且明确路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不是目录。这是挂载失败的唯一直接原因。\n- 证据 2 (K8s State) 和证据 3 (Metric) 相互印证，Pod 处于 `Pending` 且容器等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`，这与挂载卡住的状态一致。\n- 证据 4 (Metric) 确认没有重启，结合证据 5 和 6 的资源配置，排除了资源短缺、OOM 或运行时错误，进一步锁定故障点在容器启动前的挂载阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nHostPath 卷指向路径 '/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input' 非目录(或不存在) → 宿主机节点 kubelet 执行挂载时类型检查失败 → Pod 挂载卷失败，状态设为 Pending/ContainerCreating → 用户不可见应用服务\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态，其根因是 Kubernetes 节点 `node2` 上的宿主机路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不符合预期（非目录或不存）。这导致 `kubelet` 在挂载名为 `input` 的 `HostPath` 卷时，因 `type check failed` 而失败（证据 1: fact-344ed05a4cb2）。由于挂载失败，Pod 无法进入 `Running` 状态（证据 2, 3），且无重启发生（证据 4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 51.1s\n├─ 问题定位: 16.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 23.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 23.9s (Evidence 18.8s, RCA 5.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 51.056, "metrics": {"run_id": "5fb32152cf2b4783", "mttr": {"value": "51.1s", "seconds": 51.06285047531128, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 51062.85047531128, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 48611.91511154175, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 4762.158155441284, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2172.9211807250977}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15995.985269546509, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 23876.909494400024, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11169.562101364136, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

